WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:26.460
The secret to start learning a language
and keep learning it is simple: connect

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:31.830
with it emotionally. Every day, when I sit
down and I learn, I remind myself of WHY

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:35.129
I am learning.
Reminding myself of the reasons why is

00:00:35.129 --> 00:00:39.270
the most important thing you can do to
keep going. I use a simple visualization

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:44.820
technique to emotionally connect with a
language which I call S.E.E. "S" stands for

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:49.470
state. Your state of mind has a huge
impact on how you learn and how you see

00:00:49.470 --> 00:00:54.300
yourself in the now and in the future. "E"
stands for emotion.There is no learning

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:58.260
no plan, and no life without emotion. To
make things strong and solid, add

00:00:58.260 --> 00:01:03.120
emotions to whatever you do. "E" stands
for "eye", in this case the eye of your mind.

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:08.190
With this eye you can see things what
your physical eyes still cannot see. See

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:13.080
beyond to make your future real, make
your future a reality. I'm in Budapest

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:17.969
I'm standing on one side of the Margaret
bridge. On the one side of the river, in

00:01:17.969 --> 00:01:20.490
Pest, 
I see the massive Hungarian Parliament in

00:01:20.490 --> 00:01:24.659
all its illuminated glory, and on the
other side I see the green hills of

00:01:24.659 --> 00:01:28.979
Buda, now cloaked in the darkness of
night. All at once, I'm overcome with a

00:01:28.979 --> 00:01:32.609
wave of nostalgia. For a moment that
seems like an eternity, I am caught

00:01:32.609 --> 00:01:36.180
between the past and the future, and that
reminds me of when I was here for the

00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:40.920
first time some 10 years ago. And then my friend Edit comes. She smiles at me. We

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:44.340
decide to head over to a restaurant, we
order Hungarian food and we talk about

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:48.600
everything: about Hungary, Budapest, Hungarian food, Hungarian wine, about history,

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:53.300
about the differences between Hungary
and Italy. And the night goes on..

